// The application's icon, as resource 1: the id GPUI loads for its window
// class, and so what the taskbar, Alt-Tab and the title bar show. Explorer
// shows the first icon in the file for the .exe itself, which is this one.
//
// matterfast.ico is data/icons/hicolor/scalable/apps/app.akergez.Matterfast.svg
// rendered at 16, 24, 32, 48, 64 and 256 pixels; see build.rs.
1 ICON "matterfast.ico"
